**logical.hpp defines gamepad logical actions and their engine-command mapping.**

## API

`gamepad::unstable::controller::mapping::action` is a `uint8_t` enum: `none`, `fire`, `ads`, `jump_stand`, `stance`, `melee`, `use_reload`, `sprint`, `next_weapon`, `frag`, `special_grenade`, `menu`, `scoreboard`, `action_slot_1`–`action_slot_4`.

`to_string(action) noexcept` returns an action label.

`command(action) noexcept` returns engine commands such as `"+attack"` and `"weapnext"`, or `""` for `action::none`.

## Contracts

`scoreboard` maps to `"+scores"`; `"+scores"` is bindable, while `togglescores` resolves unbound and is dropped.

## Dependencies

`types.hpp` supplies `uint8_t`; `utility.hpp` supplies shared mapping support.